sempods website

The sempods mark and favicon are based on the Material Icons "Webhook" icon by
Google, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Source: https://github.com/google/material-design-icons

The SVG wrapper files copied from sempods-spec modify the exported SVG
structure, accessible labels, colour handling, padding and app-icon background.
public/images/sempods-social-preview.png is copied from the same directory and
places that mark on a solid ground with the wordmark and tagline.
